        {
          "text": "Angalieni, namtuma mjumbe wangu, naye ataitengeneza njia mbele yangu; naye Bwana mnayemtafuta atalijilia hekalu lake ghafula; naam, yule mjumbe wa agano mnayemfurahia, angalieni, anakuja, asema BWANA wa majeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
