        {
          "text": "naye ataketi kama asafishaye fedha na kuitakasa, naye atawatakasa wana wa Lawi, atawasafisha kama dhahabu na fedha; nao watamtolea BWANA dhabihu katika haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
